 Bastet ("bastard Tetris") is a free clone of Tetris which tries to
 compute how useful blocks are and gives you the worst possible brick.
 Playing bastet can be a painful experience, especially if you usually
 make "canyons" and wait for the long I-shaped block.

Package: batalert
Description-md5: 4a30da299a07e14e930604af30e8b9b7
Description-en: Battery notifications/alerts for your favorite WM!
 batalert (aka Battery Alert) is a tool, written in Ruby,
 to notify the users when their battery is either under-charged
 (default: < 10%) or over-charged (default: > 90%).
 .
