 endx2xml, isi2xml, med2xml, ris2xml which convert to MODS XML format,
 modsclean which reformats MODS XML, and a matching set of commands
 xml2ads, xml2bib, xml2end, xml2isi, xml2ris, xml2wordbib which convert
 from MODS XML.

